OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for most, with
OL,6,Fany early fog patches soon clearing.
OL,7,FCloudier conditions will tentatively
OL,8,Fbuild around lunchtime but the cloud
OL,9,Fwill often break to allow sunny spells
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling warm in
OL,11,Fthe sun.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRather cloudy and mainly dry
OL,14,Fthis evening and overnight although
OL,15,Fthe odd shower cannot be ruled out,
OL,16,Fparticularly over Cambridgeshire
OL,17,Faround dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
