OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FShowers soon developing and
OL,6,Fmerging into a broad area of heavy
OL,7,Frain, briefly accompanied by strong
OL,8,Fwinds. Turning drier and brighter
OL,9,Flater, though remaining breezy with a
OL,10,Ffew coastal showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,13,Fand sunny on Thursday after a chilly
OL,14,Fstart. Cloud increasing on Friday with
OL,15,Fpatchy rain arriving overnight. Chilly
OL,16,Fwith early fog on Saturday, then
OL,17,Fbrighter with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
